config TESTING_DCPTEST
	tristate "dcptest: the RP2350's double-precision coprocessor"
	default n
	depends on ARCH_CHIP_RP23XX
	---help---
		The coprocessor's double-precision helpers (rp23xx_dcp.S) against
		libgcc's soft-float, bit for bit, on millions of operands of every
		class; their speed; and their use from threads on both cores under
		preemption (docs/hardware-accel.md).
